{"product_id":"doctor-who-the-visual-dictionary","title":"Doctor Who: The Visual Dictionary","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis beautifully illustrated Doctor Who Visual Dictionary is now updated and expanded to include the latest Doctor Who facts including the Twelfth Doctor and Doctor Who season 8 storylines\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eBursting with action-packed images and little-known facts Doctor Who - The Visual Dictionary Updated and Expanded is ideal for any fan of Doctor Who.  Covering the very latest facts and details, including the Twelfth Doctor Peter Capaldi and Doctor Who season 8 storylines.  Covering every single Doctor and each of his companions plus unforgettable villains, you'll have all the tricks and secrets of Doctor Who at your fingertips.\u003c\/p\u003e  \n\n\u003cp\u003eStep into the Tardis, battle Cybermen and Daleks, and discover all the Doctor's secrets in this visually stunning guide to the Doctor Who universe. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:259 x 303  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jason Loborik | Simon Beecroft | David John | Kerrie Dougherty | Andrew Darling | Jacqueline Rayner | Neil Corry \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780241184295 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Lenticular Hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 176\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44889091866777,"sku":"17RF-1-9780241184295","price":40.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/41723dec6983547bc38b25d1d3709434.jpg?v=1752150751","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/doctor-who-the-visual-dictionary","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}